        "An SAP system landscape is defined by business and functional requirements.",
        "Business and functional requirements determine the SAP solutions used in an SAP system landscape.",
        "Business and functional requirements determine how applications run on the available infrastructure.",
        "An SAP system landscape is a group of two or more SAP systems.",
        "The SAP systems in an SAP system landscape typically serve development, quality assurance and testing, and production purposes.",
        "The design of an SAP system landscape depends on the requirements of the business.",
        "The design of an SAP system landscape includes system instances and tracks."
    ]
}
